# The player's own sounds: on Load Screen, in Hands, in context (the drums and the hats low), each layer in turn, about 30 s, through the sound editor as a hand has it: first its first sound; then the ratio goes up its list, through whole numbers and inharmonic ones; a bell's ratio; the depth up and back; a fast envelope; a slow one. Strange bells are the owner's choice. The times are in the file.
#   PYTHON=.venv/bin/python3 sh build.sh --host && mkdir -p app/build/listen && app/build/host/aq1_host tests/listen/user_sounds.amb app/build/listen
wait 100
tap SAVE
wait 800
reboot
seed 3101
master 2430
setpar 2 50
press SEL
tap LFO
tap SEQ
tap FX
release SEL
setpar 16 25
setpar 18 25
setpar 12 30
setpar 4 42
setpar 8 0
wait 3000
trace app/build/listen/user_sounds.trace
wav user_sounds.wav
